    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Following are the Principles that provide the foundation for the Plan to address the waiting list in Pennsylvania. All decisions and actions related to the provision of mental retardation services and supports are to be weighed against these principles."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
    "id" : 28,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 52.667, 444.0, 144.667, 461.333 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
    "font size" : 14.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Everyday Lives"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 30,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 52.667, 374.667, 383.333, 434.667 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Everyday Lives, published in 1991, expresses the values upon which the Pennsylvania Mental Retardation Service System is based. Everyday Lives presented what people with disabilities said is important to them."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 32,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 54.333, 334.667, 378.667, 362.667 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Choice in the decisions of life; choice of jobs, friends, recreation, where and with whom to live."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 34,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.667, 293.0, 387.333, 321.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Control of relationships, money, transportation, services, medicine and staff."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 35,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.0, 249.0, 356.667, 279.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Permanency with a life in the community among family and friends; no fear of returning to the institution."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 36,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 52.0, 206.667, 376.0, 238.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Security and protection for those who have difficulty in communication; competent services; and safety in the community."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 38,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.667, 179.0, 260.333, 193.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Freedom of movement, and from stigma."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 40,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.0, 151.0, 370.333, 165.667 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Prosperity freedom from poverty and a chance to be successful."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 41,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 52.333, 108.667, 361.333, 140.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Individuality by having a name and a personal history and by making a difference; having dignity and status."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 43,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.667, 81.0, 293.0, 96.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Relationships with friends, family and partners."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 44,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 53.0, 51.667, 277.246, 69.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Recognition of abilities, capacities and gifts."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 25,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 404.0, 513.667, 705.667, 545.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Privacy of records, files and histories; protection from being labeled and the option of living alone."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 27,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 404.667, 459.0, 730.0, 504.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Citizenship as part of the community, having a feeling of connectedness, partnership in dreams and beliefs; playing a part in decisions which affect you."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 29,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 405.333, 416.667, 701.0, 445.667 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Passion in advocates and self-advocates to fight and dream together."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
    "id" : 31,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 405.333, 371.0, 502.333, 386.0 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
    "font size" : 14.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Multi-Year Plan"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 33,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 404.667, 217.0, 738.0, 358.667 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The Multi-Year Plan, published in 1997, builds on the promise of Everyday Lives in terms of goals, recommendations, and action steps. The Multi-Year Plan is a plan for the future which provides a backdrop for recommendations to address the waiting list in Pennsylvania. It included a major goal to realign resources to meet the needs of those on the waiting list. While resource realignment has addressed the need of some people on the waiting list, we have concluded that the realignment of resources alone will not provide sufficient resources to meet the needs of all who are on the waiting list."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 37,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 405.667, 187.667, 491.865, 201.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Two major goals:"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 39,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 404.667, 145.667, 736.0, 175.333 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "System Reform: restructuring the system to one that is: ConsumerDriven, Values-Based, Outcome-Oriented, and Cost-Efficient."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 42,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 404.667, 88.0, 725.333, 133.0 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRoman",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Resource Realignment: realigning existing resources to meet the needs of those on the waiting list while maintaining necessary supports and services for individuals currently receiving them."
  } ]
}